Examples:
THINK: Enemy Geodude is Rock/Ground type. My Squirtle's BUBBLE is Water type, super effective!
ACTION: MOVE:BUBBLE

THINK: My pokemon is at 3 HP against a much stronger wild opponent, better flee.
ACTION: RUN

THINK: Enemy is Normal type with no special advantage. I'll just attack with my strongest move.
ACTION: MOVE:TACKLE

THINK: My Charmander is at 2 HP and will faint next turn. I have a healthy Squirtle -- switching to survive.
ACTION: SWITCH:SQUIRTLE